Windows test executable manifest
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src-tauri/build.rs adapts the MSVC linker-manifest workaround from Tauri's
examples/api/src-tauri/build.rs. src-tauri/windows-app-manifest.xml contains
Tauri's Common-Controls dependency manifest from crates/tauri-build/src.
Copyright 2019-2024 Tauri Programme within The Commons Conservancy.
Used under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).
https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri
The oxAudit adaptation applies only to Windows MSVC targets and uses our local
manifest path; it does not require Tauri's internal workspace environment flag.
